==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Fire Keese Wings are [[Material]]s that are dropped by [[Fire Keese]], which can be found flying in the [[Eldin (Region)|Eldin]] and [[Akkala]] [[Region]]s. They can be exchanged for six [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] or sold for six [[Rupee]]s. Like other [[Monster Part]]s, Fire Keese Wings can be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s. Fire Keese Wings can also be used to produce [[Red Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

Fire Keese Wings are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Fire Keese Wing}}

